"""Tiantasks: task and issue queues with a live local web page and a CLI.

Everything lives in one SQLite database (~/.tiantasks/tiantasks.db), so there
is nothing to stage or commit. `tt ui` serves the page; every other command
reads and writes the same database, which is how Claude Code picks up,
reports and closes work.
"""

